 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6z03FQIyQQgQ7kNvwH6LNsZ&_nc_oc=AdqvRrWwxpgvqNbUm0G9OVTE8jKeeUOOBMyRXVixrkNm6qyXV59uGWbvD1-U928wU6Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL09n17-QduyweR65NY03LeweAKPCnNqKqUd2G8_e_S2w&oe=6A9ED5C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fc9Ti4z2f20Q7kNvwF2cKvA&_nc_oc=AdptGTJZ2Y09hHuptJ3IaeI97cmpAx3Nc7yo4_HYbpEIimhaBQmvGfN5BrKVlWl5R50&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI2ccxsdXFP5ck-jIl-PIBuG-ekqCLKMFgMANtXbQoEow&oe=6A9EAAE6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LSBD4gZAqXwQ7kNvwF7BCDB&_nc_oc=Adr4-ee3LWal8fWSYA35Ydu_ETc_ytpIFjYMpkJfuJTQxdW2dxPP9nP9dP_jHgcz6y8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLJkcSfo3qtn5lr8_-JxHA9vG0aaqZTLM1vKHg0tsQDwg&oe=6A9EB4DC"}, {"fil